  "html": "<article data-article-id=\"894895bc-1b0b-4f33-a9b9-b7242c114387\">\n  <p class=\"poem\">I never cut my neighbor’s throat,<br>\n  My neighbor’s gold I never stole;<br>\n  I never spoiled his house and land;<br>\n  But God have mercy on my soul!</p>\n\n  <p class=\"poem\">For I am haunted night and day<br>\n  By all the deeds I have not done;<br>\n  Oh, unattempted loveliness!<br>\n  Oh, costly valor never won!</p>\n</article>\n",
